  {
   "id": "t01",
   "text": "George Washington. *Wooden teeth.*",
   "frames": 117
  },
  {
   "id": "t02",
   "text": "Nope. *No wood at all.*",
   "frames": 68
  },
  {
   "id": "t03",
   "text": "Washington: *the wooden teeth myth.*",
   "frames": 69
  },
  {
   "id": "t04",
   "text": "His teeth were *terrible.*",
   "frames": 74
  },
  {
   "id": "t05",
   "text": "By 1789, he had *one* tooth left.",
   "frames": 120
  },
  {
   "id": "t06",
   "text": "So he wore *dentures.*",
   "frames": 67
  },
  {
   "id": "t07",
   "text": "Made of *hippo ivory.*",
   "frames": 73
  },
  {
   "id": "t08",
   "text": "Cow teeth. *Horse teeth.*",
   "frames": 77
  },
  {
   "id": "t09",
   "text": "Metal springs and *lead.*",
   "frames": 81
  },
  {
   "id": "t10",
   "text": "And *human* teeth.",
   "frames": 66
  },
  {
   "id": "t11",
   "text": "Some were bought from *enslaved people* at Mount Vernon.",
   "frames": 124
  },
  {
   "id": "t12",
   "text": "The springs pushed his jaws *apart.*",
   "frames": 90
  },
  {
   "id": "t13",
   "text": "He had to clamp his mouth *shut.*",
   "frames": 84
  },
  {
   "id": "t14",
   "text": "That's the tight-lipped face on the *one dollar bill.*",
   "frames": 119
  },
  {
   "id": "t15",
   "text": "So where did the *wood* come from?",
   "frames": 78
  },
  {
   "id": "t16",
   "text": "Ivory *stains* and cracks over time.",
   "frames": 103
  },
  {
   "id": "t17",
   "text": "Old dentures can look like *wood grain.*",
   "frames": 106
  },
  {
   "id": "t18",
   "text": "Also, wood would *rot* in your mouth.",
   "frames": 95
  },
  {
   "id": "t19",
   "text": "Teeth made of wood: *zero.*",
   "frames": 83
  },
  {
   "id": "t20",
   "text": "Anyway, here's Washington with his *wooden teeth.*",
   "frames": 130
  }
 ]
